# Production - use real Power Pages auth
REACT_APP_DEV_MODE=false
# REACT_APP_ENTRA_PROVIDER and REACT_APP_GOOGLE_ANALYTICS_ID moved out of build-time
# env vars — baking per-environment values (Entra Authority URL, GA measurement ID)
# into the build meant a rebuild+redeploy was required every time either changed
# per environment. Both are now read at runtime from the actum_publicconfig Dataverse
# table (see src/services/publicConfigService.ts) so the same build works unchanged
# across DEV/TEST/PROD. Set/update the values via the maker portal, per environment,
# in the actum_publicconfig table (keys: "EntraProviderIdentifier", "GoogleAnalyticsId").